* B3_base_rlcmfb_ota_Rs5k - testbench B_tr
* LTspice, PTM 90 nm BSIM4. Open in LTspice and Run. If LTspice rejects 'level = 54' in ptm90.lib, change it to 'level = 14' (both are BSIM4).
.include ptm90.lib
Vdd vdd 0 0.45
Vss vss 0 -0.45
* bias: 2.5uA reference into NMOS diode
Ib vdd nb 2.5u
Mb nb nb vss vss nmos90 W=10u L=180n
M0 t nb vss vss nmos90 W=20u L=180n
M1 a inn t vss nmos90 W=10u L=180n
M2 b inp t vss nmos90 W=10u L=180n
M3 a cm vdd vdd pmos90 W=10u L=180n
M4 b cm vdd vdd pmos90 W=10u L=180n
Ra a cm 300k
Rb b cm 300k
M3P out b vdd vdd pmos90 W=10u L=180n
M4P c a vdd vdd pmos90 W=10u L=180n
M5 c c vss vss nmos90 W=10u L=180n
M6 out c vss vss nmos90 W=10u L=180n
Rs out o2 5k
Vml o2 oL 0
Cl oL 0 2p
Vin inp 0 dc 0 pulse(-0.2 0.2 20n 1n 1n 399n 800n)
Vsh inn out 0
.tran 0 900n 0 0.2n
.backanno
.end
